 Markdown skill file with metadata; no install scripts, dependencies, executable files, or remote payload retrieval were present.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Activation phrases are somewhat broad for generic writing requests, but they are writing-related and do not grant sensitive authority or override agent behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, background execution, memory writing, privilege escalation, or tool modification instructions were found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill's stated purpose is generating publish-ready Chinese social media content, and the artifact only provides writing workflows, formats, and quality guidelines for that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, be aware that this skill may trigger on general writing prompts, not only explicit 小红书, 知乎, 公众号, or 抖音 requests. It appears safe as a writing assistant, but users who want narrower behavior may prefer more platform-specific activation wording.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The broad activation trigger is real but low impact in this artifact: it may activate for ordinary writing tasks, yet the resulting instructions remain limited to content drafting and formatting.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789104536885}}}}}